From ac42f17c483c1f2aadab0ab3209beb8bd0294e48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1aeo <github@1aeo.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:36:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] hsdir: Add off-by-default per-descriptor and global
 fetch rate limiters

Add off-by-default per-descriptor (HSDirDescriptorLimitEnabled,
HSDirDescriptorRate, HSDirDescriptorBurst) and relay-wide
(HSDirGlobalLimitEnabled, HSDirGlobalRate, HSDirGlobalBurst) token
buckets for cached HSv3 descriptor fetches, closing the circuit with
END_CIRC_REASON_RESOURCELIMIT before queuing the ~40 KB descriptor when
enforcement is enabled, and export hsdir_desc_rate_limited and
hsdir_global_rate_limited on the MetricsPort.
