@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+  o Minor features (DoS-resistance, onion service directory):
+    - Support off-by-default per-descriptor (HSDirDescriptorLimitEnabled,
+      HSDirDescriptorRate, HSDirDescriptorBurst) and relay-wide
+      (HSDirGlobalLimitEnabled, HSDirGlobalRate, HSDirGlobalBurst) token
+      buckets for cached onion service descriptor fetches, closing circuits
