diff --git a/doc/man/tor.1.txt b/doc/man/tor.1.txt
index d6b640c..361f723 100644
--- a/doc/man/tor.1.txt
+++ b/doc/man/tor.1.txt
@@ -3189,6 +3189,52 @@ The following options are useful only for an onion service directory (HSDir).
     The count appears in the heartbeat and as
     tor_relay_dos_total{type="hsdir_unknown_prev_hop"}. (Default: auto)
 
+[[HSDirDescriptorLimitEnabled]] **HSDirDescriptorLimitEnabled** **0**|**1**|**auto**::
+
+    If set to 1, an HSDir rate-limits repeated fetches of any single cached
+    onion service descriptor using a per-descriptor token bucket controlled by
+    **HSDirDescriptorRate** and **HSDirDescriptorBurst**, closing the circuit
+    (with reason RESOURCELIMIT) before queuing the ~40 KB descriptor when its
+    bucket is exhausted. If 0, it only counts rate-limit hits in
+    tor_relay_dos_total{type="hsdir_desc_rate_limited"}. "auto" uses the
+    hsdir_desc_limit_enabled consensus parameter (default: 0, count only).
+    (Default: auto)
+
+[[HSDirDescriptorRate]] **HSDirDescriptorRate** __N__::
+
+    Refill rate in requests per second for each cached onion service
+    descriptor's fetch token bucket. If 0, uses the hsdir_desc_rate consensus
+    parameter, which defaults to 5. (Default: 0)
+
+[[HSDirDescriptorBurst]] **HSDirDescriptorBurst** __N__::
+
+    Maximum burst in requests for each cached onion service descriptor's fetch
+    token bucket. If 0, uses the hsdir_desc_burst consensus parameter, which
+    defaults to 20. (Default: 0)
+
+[[HSDirGlobalLimitEnabled]] **HSDirGlobalLimitEnabled** **0**|**1**|**auto**::
+
+    If set to 1, an HSDir rate-limits total cached onion service descriptor
+    fetches across the relay using a global token bucket controlled by
+    **HSDirGlobalRate** and **HSDirGlobalBurst**, closing the circuit (with
+    reason RESOURCELIMIT) before queuing the ~40 KB descriptor when the bucket
+    is exhausted. If 0, it only counts rate-limit hits in
+    tor_relay_dos_total{type="hsdir_global_rate_limited"}. "auto" uses the
+    hsdir_global_limit_enabled consensus parameter (default: 0, count only).
+    (Default: auto)
+
+[[HSDirGlobalRate]] **HSDirGlobalRate** __N__::
+
+    Refill rate in requests per second for the relay-wide cached onion service
+    descriptor fetch token bucket. If 0, uses the hsdir_global_rate consensus
+    parameter, which defaults to 50. (Default: 0)
+
+[[HSDirGlobalBurst]] **HSDirGlobalBurst** __N__::
+
+    Maximum burst in requests for the relay-wide cached onion service
+    descriptor fetch token bucket. If 0, uses the hsdir_global_burst consensus
+    parameter, which defaults to 200. (Default: 0)
+
 
 For onion services, mitigations are a work in progress and multiple options
 are currently available.
